<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Büşra Pehlivanlar"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Elif Özkanat"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Enes Ulucan"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This ontology models an intelligent recommendation system that provides personalized content suggestions based on the user's emotional state, contextual situation, personality traits, and needs. Phase 2 adds DynamicEmotion, BehaviorProfile, EmotionSession, UserInteraction, and DataSource classes inspired by Norouzi et al. (2025) ontology population with LLMs and Fernandez et al. (2023) GRU-RNN behavioral prediction."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-05-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "Manisa Celal Bayar University"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Emotion-Aware Intelligent Recommendation Ontology"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "ex" .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#" .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ontology for modeling personalized recommendations based on user emotions, needs, context, personality traits, preferences, content types, and content effects. Version 2 extends the ontology with dynamic emotion tracking, behavioral prediction, LLM-based population support, and session-level interaction modeling."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Emotion-Aware Intelligent Recommendation Ontology"@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#priorVersion> "1.0.0" .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0.0" .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#EmotionAwareRecommendationOntology> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/elifozknt/emotion-aware-recommendation-ontology> .
