# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AgreeablePersonality
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AgreeablePersonality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AgreeablePersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Personality> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AgreeablePersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A personality type characterized by cooperativeness, empathy, and trust. Agreeable users tend to enjoy emotionally warm content (e.g., feel-good movies, collaborative games, uplifting podcasts)."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AgreeablePersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agreeable Personality"@en .
# 
# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#BehaviorProfile
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#BehaviorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#BehaviorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A classification of the user's interaction behavior style, analogous to the four behavioral classes (Cognitive, Speed, Sedentary, Aggressive) predicted by Fernandez et al. (2023). Used to personalize recommendation frequency and content depth."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#BehaviorProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Behavior Profile"@en .
# 
# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ConscientiousPersonality
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ConscientiousPersonality> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ConscientiousPersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Personality> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ConscientiousPersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A personality type characterized by organization, goal-directedness, and discipline. Conscientious users prefer structured, purposeful content (e.g., educational podcasts, productivity music, self-improvement content)."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ConscientiousPersonality> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conscientious Personality"@en .
# 
# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Content
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Content> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Content> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A digital content item or activity that can be recommended to a user."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Content> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Content"@en .
# 
# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ContentCategory
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ContentCategory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ContentCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A category describing the type of content."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#ContentCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Content Category"@en .
# 
# http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Context
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#Context> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
