<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AggressiveBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "User who skips content frequently, indicating high selectivity or stress."@en .
<http://example.org/emotion-aware-recommendation#AggressiveBehavior> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aggressive Behavior"@en .
